    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "well established" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The Europe and Central Asia region is currently food secure because of food production in the region and trade, despite the degradation of several of nature’s regulating contributions and loss of food-related indigenous and local knowledge (well established) {2.3.1.1, 2.2.1.2, 2.2.1.5, 2.2.1.7, 2.2.1.8, 2.2.2.1, 2.2.3.1}. Soil erosion has affected 25 per cent of agricultural land in the European Union and 23 per cent in Central Asia." ;
