<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/ECA18-2.2.1.8.1> a ipbes:SubChapter ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/ECA18ch2> ;
    ipbes:Reference <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345951/items/22F79GZT>,
